│ process. The screenshot shows that removing  │
│ the whitespace from the .tex file produced   │
│ by the LaTeX writer resolves the issue. The  │
│ key is to prevent sphinxupquote from adding  │
│ these extra spaces.  I believe a simple      │
│ modification to the sphinxupquote function   │
│ to remove the leading/trailing whitespace is │
